  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "EntityPicker is a RendererBehaviour responsible for implementing scene entity picking within the editor. It renders the entire scene geometry to an off-screen texture, using unique entity IDs embedded in the rendering pass. Upon a mouse click, it reads the pixel data at the cursor position to determine the selected entity ID. It manages selection state by notifying the SceneTreeService and updating the GizmosBoxBehaviour."
  },
